      <div type="source-image" n="Inside upper cover and p. [1]" facs="#surface-f02" xml:id="f02">
        <note type="layout">影像與物理面對照：blank inside front + p1 title at left。單位按物理面右至左及原固定欄序排列；有明確觀察的版心題字與頁碼另列於各面欄文之後，不視為正文續句；未見字不補。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only", "original-print": "AI-initial-transcription-unreviewed"}</note>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f02" xml:id="p01-c01">咸豐九年新鐫</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f02" xml:id="p01-c02">另新附留痘漿妙法</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f02" xml:id="p01-c03">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f02" xml:id="p01-c04">博濟醫局藏板</ab>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [2]-[3]" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="f03">
        <note type="layout">影像與物理面對照：p2 bleedthrough at right + p3 at left。右側p02為題頁透印，不重錄為另一份正文；左側p03有歷史印刷文字。單位按物理面右至左及原固定欄序排列；有明確觀察的版心題字與頁碼另列於各面欄文之後，不視為正文續句；未見字不補。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only", "original-print": "AI-initial-transcription-unreviewed"}</note>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c01">種痘論</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c02">種痘之法、多在手臂上約寸餘步仿用尖</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c03">利刀仔、或用針、輕輕挑破皮左右每兩三</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c04">處、以不見血流為妙、再用刀尖染些痘漿</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c05">搽在挑破處、倘若手重、挑皮深破、待息間</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c06">血止、然後染漿種入、此一法也、更有不用</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c07">先挑破皮、卽將刀尖染痘漿、每粒處輕輕</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c08">刺五六點、其漿自然從所刺之處種入、此</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-c09">法較為簡捷、種期必以七日至九日為準、</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-running-title">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="left" facs="#surface-f03" xml:id="p03-printed-page-number">一</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#p03-c02" corresp="uncertainties.json#unc-001" xml:id="unc-001">{"candidates": ["仿", "位"], "cause": "initial-reading-uncertainty", "end": 15, "extent": "known", "id": "unc-001", "reason": "步仿末字按圖暫讀仿，不以文意改位。", "start": 14, "surface": "仿", "unit_id": "p03-c02"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [4]-[5]" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="f04">
        <note type="layout">影像與物理面對照：p4 right + p5 left。單位按物理面右至左及原固定欄序排列；有明確觀察的版心題字與頁碼另列於各面欄文之後，不視為正文續句；未見字不補。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only", "original-print": "AI-initial-transcription-unreviewed"}</note>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c01">因所種者、必俟七八日然後滿漿、漿滿方</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c02">能傳種別人、旣種之後兩三日間見有紅</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c03">點、似蚊口、四五日間漸漸起小泡、八日然</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c04">後滿漿、其色畧黃、似珍珠四圍根脚有紅</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c05">線圍任九日十日至紅周圍堅硬畧有些</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c06">腫、十一日漸消中間先變白色、然後結痂、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c07">十四日至十八日、然後掃痂、掃痂後有痘</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c08">瘢、凡小兒種痘、最好是出世後百日半歲</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-c09">之間、惟出牙之時、身體不甚自在、不宜種、</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-running-title">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="right" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p04-printed-page-number">一</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c01">或身體有別樣病痛、亦不宜種、種後必出、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c02">或有時種不合法、其漿不能種入、故痘不</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c03">出者有之、須多次種之、以種至必出為止、</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c04">大抵旣種之後、身體必有些發熱、然後灌</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c05">漿、漿滿後仍覺身體不安、穿着衣服、最要</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c06">小心、勿令擦破、倘擦破見有熱痛用牛乳</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c07">或粥渣貼之自愈、痘漿最要揀擇瘋疾者</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c08">固不取用、虛弱者亦不取用、種時揀擇好</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-c09">漿、種了一人之後、至八日漿滿、可將此人痘</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-running-title">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="left" facs="#surface-f04" xml:id="p05-printed-page-number">二</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#p04-c05" corresp="uncertainties.json#unc-002" xml:id="unc-002">{"candidates": ["任", "在"], "cause": "initial-reading-uncertainty", "end": 3, "extent": "known", "id": "unc-002", "reason": "按圖暫讀任，句法不順不自動改字。", "start": 2, "surface": "任", "unit_id": "p04-c05"}</note>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#p05-c07" corresp="uncertainties.json#unc-003" xml:id="unc-003">{"candidates": ["粥"], "cause": "initial-reading-uncertainty", "end": 2, "extent": "known", "id": "unc-003", "reason": "待較高解析與盲讀核右左部件。", "start": 1, "surface": "粥", "unit_id": "p05-c07"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [6]-[7]" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="f05">
        <note type="layout">影像與物理面對照：p6 right + p7 left。單位按物理面右至左及原固定欄序排列；有明確觀察的版心題字與頁碼另列於各面欄文之後，不視為正文續句；未見字不補。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only", "original-print": "AI-initial-transcription-unreviewed"}</note>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c01">漿傳種別人、出一粒者可傳種幾人、出兩</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c02">三粒者可傳種多人、唐人不肯將痘漿傳</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c03">種別人、且又種痘獨趂春暖時候、天冷天</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c04">熱、俱少人種、是以痘漿不能接續、必待外</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c05">國帶來、始有得用、其實不必定用痘漿、痘</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c06">痂亦可用、留痂之法、將小兒所落痘痂用</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c07">錫箔包固、銅箔亦可再用紙包、外用蠟兩</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c08">塊合埋、密其合口、勿令發壞、雖兩三年可</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-c09">用、臨用時取出的用水濕透調勻便可作</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-running-title">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="right" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p06-printed-page-number">二</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c01">痘漿用、如此家家明曉、藏好痘痂依佢種</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c02">法、自己便能與子女傳種、不須外國帶來</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c03">痘漿、又不須費銀延請醫士、豈不甚便、余</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c04">來粵東贈醫各症、兼贈種痘、每見貧人苦</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c05">於無貲難求醫士、以致虛延數歲猶有未</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c06">種者、偶遇痘症時行甚為可慮、茲將種痘</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c07">捷法、刋送廣傳、俾遠近皆明種法、不用求</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c08">人、及早自種、可以無虞痘患、是所厚望也</ab>
        <ab type="title" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-c09">留痘漿妙法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="left" facs="#surface-f05" xml:id="p07-printed-page-number">三</ab>
        <note type="transcription-uncertainty" target="#p07-c01" corresp="uncertainties.json#unc-004" xml:id="unc-004">{"candidates": ["依佢"], "cause": "initial-reading-uncertainty", "end": 17, "extent": "known", "id": "unc-004", "reason": "疑為口語用字，不正規化為其他詞。", "start": 15, "surface": "依佢", "unit_id": "p07-c01"}</note>
      </div>
      <div type="source-image" n="pp. [8]-[9]" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="f06">
        <note type="layout">影像與物理面對照：p8 right + p9 left。單位按物理面右至左及原固定欄序排列；有明確觀察的版心題字與頁碼另列於各面欄文之後，不視為正文續句；未見字不補。</note>
        <note type="layout-reviewed">true</note>
        <note type="layer-states">{"later-library-marks": "excluded-described-only", "original-print": "AI-initial-transcription-unreviewed"}</note>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c01">種痘一道不留痘漿、固不能傳種別人、不</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c02">善留痘漿亦不能隨時接續、其法莫善於</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c03">用一玻璃小筒長約二寸餘、其管口以極</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c04">細為妙、遂向滿漿之童子、小心以刀尖刺</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c05">破其痘然後將此玻璃小筒輕輕印之、其</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c06">漿自然入於管內、至於痘漿多少不一、惟</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c07">擇壯旺者佳、總之每一玻璃小筒以裝一</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c08">小半為度、待痘漿入後、遂打橫向燈火輕</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-c09">輕煖之、但不可煖正其漿、煖後卽以指捂</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-running-title">種痘</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="right" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p08-printed-page-number">三</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c01">住不近漿之一頭、其漿自然乘火氣而行</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c02">以行到中間為妥、如果行到中間、卽將燈</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c03">火燒鎔兩頭令其埋口、倘或不到中間、其</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c04">不近漿之一頭、仍用火埋口、其近漿之一</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c05">頭、則另用蠟封口、如此則痘漿方不洩氣</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c06">亦不致壞、大約雖兩三載亦可用也、臨用</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c07">時、打開兩頭、用口吹出以碟盛之、卽能取</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c08">漿傳種、豈不便捷、依此法多為預備、自可</ab>
        <ab type="body" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-c09">隨時濟人、非所謂盡美盡善歟</ab>
        <ab type="running-title" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-running-title">種痘捷法</ab>
        <ab type="printed-page-number" n="left" facs="#surface-f06" xml:id="p09-printed-page-number">四</ab>
      </div>
